Subject: [PATCH] GBM: retain 10-bit CB1 HDR10 output on NVIDIA R580

Use a probed RGB10_A2 target and two GBM scanout buffers when R580 has no 10-bit EGL window.
The reversed GLES blit and readback adapt hadesdevls’ LibreELEC Hades 1.0 Kodi patch 9719.

